## Usage

1. Open your gh-dash config file:

   ```bash
   ${EDITOR:-vim} ~/.config/gh-dash/config.yml
   ```

2. Copy the entire `theme:` section from {% for v in variants %}`{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}.yml`{% if not loop.last %} or {% endif %}{% endfor %} and paste it into your config.

3. Restart gh-dash to apply the theme.
